%% title: Flowchart
%% summary: Decisions and pipelines — here a deploy gate with an automatic rollback.
%% updated: 2026-10-11
flowchart TD
  push[git push] --> ci{CI green?}
  ci -->|no| fix[Fix and retry]
  fix --> push
  ci -->|yes| canary[Canary 5%]
  canary --> slo{SLO holds?}
  slo -->|yes| full[Roll out 100%]
  slo -->|no| rollback[Rollback]
